/// Synopsis: the documented limits of the animations in columns, each next to its way out: a `#pause` in a column covers the next column badly: its callout is veiled in bands, its shape and its image not at all, and a list alone in it is veiled but written as plain text (`->`) or keeps its markers unveiled (`-`) (`#uncover("2-")` around the content of the next columns veils it whole, also on a third step). The other documented limits are in the other `sections/pause-limits-*` tests; "Unsupported mark" in `tests/errors/`; the covered content that runs on to the next page in `sections/pause-overflow`.
